{% if system_prompt -%}
[SYSTEM]
{{ system_prompt }}
{% else -%}
[SYSTEM]
You are an intelligent tabular data extraction system. You can analyze text and extract structured information in tabular format, identifying key data points and organizing them systematically.
{% endif %}

{% if description -%}
{{ description }}

{% endif -%}

{% if domain -%}
## Domain: {{ domain }}
Please extract data relevant to the {{ domain }} domain.
{% endif %}

{% if table_schema -%}
## Expected Table Structure:
{% for column in table_schema -%}
- **{{ column.name }}**: {{ column.description }}{% if column.type %} ({{ column.type }}){% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if examples -%}
## Examples:
{% for example in examples -%}
**Text:** {{ example.text }}
**Extracted Table:**
{{ example.table }}

{% endfor -%}
{% endif %}

## Text to Analyze:
{{ text }}

{% if extraction_rules -%}
## Extraction Rules:
{% for rule in extraction_rules -%}
- {{ rule }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if output_format == "json" -%}
Please format your response as JSON:
```json
{
  "table": [
    {
      "column1": "value1",
      "column2": "value2"
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "rows_extracted": 0,
    "confidence": 0.0
  }
}
```
{% elif output_format == "csv" -%}
Please format as CSV:
```csv
column1,column2,column3
value1,value2,value3
```
{% elif output_format == "markdown" -%}
Please format as Markdown table:
| Column1 | Column2 | Column3 |
|---------|---------|---------|
| value1  | value2  | value3  |
{% else -%}
## Extracted Table:
{% endif -%}